/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E6%97%A0%E7%95%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%B3%E6%9C%AF%E5%A3%AB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fa/8ynka6fpo7k1jcndods3kmj2kq7rjqq.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E6%97%A0%E7%95%8F%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%B3%E6%9C%AF%E5%A3%AB.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/fa/8ynka6fpo7k1jcndods3kmj2kq7rjqq.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />无畏的女术士\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，攻击受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"持续伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">持续伤害</font></span></span>]的目标时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，攻击受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"持续伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">持续伤害</font></span></span>]的目标时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，攻击受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"持续伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">持续伤害</font></span></span>]的目标时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>；触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰火律动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冰火律动</font></span></span>]时，魔攻提高<font color=\"#d68fe2\">10%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"远见之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/40px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/60px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/80px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"远见之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/40px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/60px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/80px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> 20<img alt=\"勇气之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/40px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/60px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9a/6dleo3p17ck5tknku8e0evg4bq1vbpg.png/80px-%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，三级：120<img alt=\"远见之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/40px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/3cci05qpyelokxmo1facd15gigt8ao7.png/60px-%E8%BF%9C%E8%A7%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwi